    "text": "I, K. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation hereby declare under Sub- section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
